# Pre-Export Apple Notes Journals

Export journals from Apple Notes before nightly consolidation.

1. Execute: `/usr/bin/python3 {{MINERU_HOME}}/scripts/export-journals.py 30`
2. Output is logged by launchd to `logs/pre-export-journals/launchd-stdout.log`.
3. Do NOT deliver via Telegram or any channel — this is infrastructure-only.
